span>: Alright.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then, go home and have a hot shower. It will help you relax.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok, do you know how to write a great essay?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have a lot of resources on my computer. When I get home, I'll e-mail you the information.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds great! I really appreciate it.", "id": 3, "time": "29500", "image": "engenn5le10ob08re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le10ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "Learn how to write an essay.", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Prepares for Final Exams"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Writing the Final Paper"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar,  vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le10ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Elements of an Essay"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Introduction: An introduction starts with general statements and then moves to your specific topic, ending in the thesis. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Thesis: Your introduction should end with a clear, specific thesis statement, which will tell readers what your paper will be arguing. Each body paragraph will directly and support your thesis. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Body Paragraphs: An essay usually has at least three body paragraphs, and these will be the arguments, evidence, or topics that support your thesis."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Topic Sentences: Each body paragraph will begin with a topic sentence which introduces its topic. All of the information in that paragraph will be related to that topic sentence. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Support: You use arguments, data, facts, analysis,  examples, details, etc. to support your topic sentences. You should have at least three points to support each topic sentence. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Conclusion: A conclusion should wrap up your essay, it should not introduce new information or arguments. It should begin with a sentence that looks like your thesis and then draw your paper neatly to a close. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stretched too thin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be unable to complete tasks properly because of time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm being stretched too thin."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about school."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "running out of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not have enough time to complete something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am running out of time to write my English essay."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "advice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not have enough time to complete something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like some advice?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "clear your head"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to relax your mind"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to go to the park and clear your head."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "thesis"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "The sentence in an essay that tells the reader exactly what your paper will be arguing."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have to include a thesis in your essay."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using the Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">past tense</span> when talking about actions that have already happened.<br><br>Examples:<br><ul><li>Yesterday, I ate potatoes for dinner.</li><li>I bought these pants last week.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">past continuous tense</span> when talking about actions in the past that happened for a period of time.<br><br>Examples:<ul><li>She was always talking during class.</li><li>She was never on time for our meetings.</li></ul>"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the Internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find a simple English essay on a topic of your choice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the essay."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the essay outline below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Topic:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thesis statement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is the first paragraph about?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is the second paragraph about?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is the third paragraph about?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What does the conclusion include?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Which examples do it give to support the main points?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research ways to communicate through writing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I complete a table to show understanding."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain the main points of the essay to a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}